My train arrives at the final station.
The train doors open.
I get off the train.
Many people also get off here.
I go towards the escalator.
The escalator takes me down.
I reach the exit gate.
I tap my metro card at the gate.
I come outside the station onto the street.
Now I am very close to the sea.
There is a little humidity in the weather today.
But a nice breeze is also blowing.
This breeze comes directly from the sea.
There is a salty smell in the air.
I like this smell a lot.
I can see the sea waves from here.
Now I need to go to a nearby old shop.
